SUMMARY:TradePilot — refresh Upstox token if needed
DESCRIPTION:1) Check UI Live banner /api/v1/product/status live_ready\n2) If not live or 401s: mint new UPSTOX_ACCESS_TOKEN\n3) Paste into repo .env\n4) Restart API (python run_api.py --host 127.0.0.1 --port 8001)\nSee docs/LIVE_OPS.md
STATUS:CONFIRMED
END:VEVENT
